{"id":"6f5c1c06855096fa","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-symmetric.md","title":"Symmetric","display":"df-symmetric — Symmetric","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-symmetric","aliases":["58-df-symmetric"],"display":"df-symmetric — Symmetric","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-binary-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-symmetric"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-symmetric</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-symmetric — Symmetric"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6d783b088eed1da1\" href=\"?note=6d783b088eed1da1\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-binary-relation.md\">../batch03/58-df-binary-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,A\\in V\">\\(R,A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Symmetric}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Symmetric}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (symmetric-relation predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symmetric} \\vdash \\mathrm{Symmetric}_S(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symmetric} \\vdash \\mathrm{Symmetric}_S(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Symmetry is invariance of a relation under swapping coordinates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-binary-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"6d783b088eed1da1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-binary-relation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Symmetric}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symmetric} \\vdash \\mathrm{Symmetric}_S(R,A)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)","display":true}],"bytes":629,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-288","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-symmetric]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1277","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-symmetric.md|58-df-symmetric]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["6d783b088eed1da1"]}